{"name":"In the Woods","hex":"#72786f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"woods","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of wood"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dense collection of trees, usually one covering a relatively small area; usually smaller than a forest.","For chemical behavior purposes, trees in full leaf (coniferous or medium-dense deciduous forests)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/woods"}],"entries":[{"title":"In the Woods","blocks":[{"text":"In the Woods is a 2007 mystery novel by Tana French about a pair of Irish detectives and their investigation of the murder of a twelve-year-old girl. It is the first book in French's Dublin Murder Squad series. The novel won several awards such as the 2008 Edgar Award for Best First Novel by an American Author, the 2008 Barry Award for Best First Novel, the 2008 Macavity Award for Best First Mystery Novel, and the 2008 Anthony Award for Best First Novel. In the Woods and The Likeness, the second book of the Dublin Murder Squad series, are the inspiration for the BBC and Starz's 2019 Dublin Murders, an eight-episode series."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3c/In_the_Woods_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_the_Woods","wikidata":"Q6013094"},{"title":"In the Woods (Louie)","blocks":[{"text":"\"In the Woods\" is the eleventh and twelfth episodes of the fourth season of the American comedy-drama television series Louie. They are the 50th and 51st overall episodes of the series and they were written and directed by Louis C.K., who also serves as the lead actor. It was released on FX on June 9, 2014."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/In_the_Woods_(Louie)","wikidata":"Q121308392"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"woods":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/En-us-woods.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/En-us-woods.ogg/En-us-woods.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey rectangle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Grey_rectangle.jpg/500px-Grey_rectangle.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_rectangle.jpg","share":0.749375},{"title":"Northern mockingbird in Green-Wood Cemetery (55669)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Northern_mockingbird_in_Green-Wood_Cemetery_%2855669%29.jpg/500px-Northern_mockingbird_in_Green-Wood_Cemetery_%2855669%29.jpg","ratio":1.323217550274223,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Northern_mockingbird_in_Green-Wood_Cemetery_(55669).jpg","share":0.19875},{"title":"Swallow Prominent on a grey wall","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg/500px-Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg","ratio":1,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Swallow_Prominent_on_a_grey_wall.jpg","share":0.19625},{"title":"The Indian grey mongoose (Urva edwardsii) mating 4","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_4.jpg/500px-The_Indian_grey_mongoose_%28Urva_edwardsii%29_mating_4.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Indian_grey_mongoose_(Urva_edwardsii)_mating_4.jpg","share":0.189375},{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","share":0.1775},{"title":"Grey Bushchat in Sillery Gaon March 2025 by Tisha Mukherjee 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f9/Grey_Bushchat_in_Sillery_Gaon_March_2025_by_Tisha_Mukher